{"name":"Radiant Dawn","hex":"#ece2ce","fetched":"2026-10-12","looked":{"definitions":[{"term":"radiant","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Adjective","definitions":["Radiating light and/or heat.","Emitted as radiation."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["A point source from which radiation is emitted.","The apparent origin, in the night sky, of a meteor shower."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/radiant"},{"term":"dawn","whole":false,"parts":[{"part":"Verb","definitions":["To begin to brighten with daylight.","To start to appear or become obvious."]},{"part":"Noun","definitions":["The morning twilight period immediately before sunrise.","The rising of the sun."]}],"link":"https://en.wiktionary.org/wiki/dawn"}],"entries":[{"title":"Fire Emblem: Radiant Dawn","blocks":[{"text":"Fire Emblem: Radiant Dawn is a tactical role-playing game developed by Intelligent Systems and published by Nintendo for the Wii home console. It is the tenth entry in the Fire Emblem series, and acts as a direct sequel to the 2005 GameCube title Fire Emblem: Path of Radiance. It was released in 2007 in Japan and North America, and 2008 in Europe and Australia."}],"image":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/en/d/d4/Fire_Emblem_Radiant_Dawn_Box_Art.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail_unscaled","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Fire_Emblem%3A_Radiant_Dawn"},{"title":"Dawn","blocks":[{"text":"Dawn is the time that marks the beginning of twilight before sunrise. It is recognized by the appearance of indirect daylight being scattered in Earth's atmosphere, when the centre of the Sun's disc has reached 18° below the observer's horizon. This morning twilight period will last until sunrise, when direct daylight outshines the diffused light."}],"image":"https://thumb.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/thumb/1/14/Desert_Dawn.jpg/330px-Desert_Dawn.jpg?utm_source=en.wikipedia.org&utm_campaign=api&utm_content=thumbnail","link":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Dawn"}